            "review_text": "jemnic2018\nLondon, United Kingdom75 contributions\n0\nClay is cool\nMay 2025 • Couples\nClay was recommended by my sister in law and quite frankly was superb.\nTucked away down a narrow lane you would not expect to find a beautiful multi floor restaurant and bar with an extensive river frontage.\nThe layout, style and furnishings were beautifully curated and with a variety of tropical planting and subtle lighting the ambiance created was cool and calming.\nThe staff were happy and welcoming and gave great advice. There was an extensive cocktail and wine list.\nWe selected the Royal seafood platter and it did not disappoint with a great selection of Oysters, prawns, tiger prawn and Lobster. The team even peeled the seafood for you to avoid the need for finger bowls- a great service.\nThere was a resident DJ playing mellow and soulful tunes.\nThis was our most expensive meal in Vietnam but the quality was truly exceptional. The same meal at home would have been at least 3 or 4 times more.\nRead more\nWritten May 3, 2025",
            "rating": 5.0,
