            "review_text": "Lisa C\n93 contributions\n0\nFabulous setting and food\nFeb 2025 • Couples\nStumbled across this fabulous restaurant whilst looking for the river. Initially though we would stop for a drink only, it’s a modern clean but cosy venue and in a lovely setting by the river. The cocktails were really good so we decided to stay for dinner. All dishes were beautifully presented, attention to detail showed. We had steak and barramundi both cooked to perfection. The staff were attentive and welcoming. Starters, mains and desserts with 3 drinks each came to around £60 so more expensive then some other restaurants but probably not in this area. Certainly worth it, I’d highly recommend.\nRead more\nWritten February 25, 2025",
