            "review_text": "H G\nManila, Philippines10 contributions\n0\nA Memorable Night at Clay Saigon\nFeb 2025 • Couples\nFeb 20 - Thursday \n\nA Memorable Night at Clay Saigon\n\nOur dining experience at Clay Saigon was nothing short of exceptional! From the stunning ambiance to the impeccable service, every detail made the night truly special.\n\nWe were seated at the corner with a beautiful river view, which added to the charm of the evening. A special shoutout to our server, the gentleman wearing glasses, who not only provided outstanding service but also recommended the best cocktail of the night—a drink that the birthday celebrant absolutely loved!\n\nThe entire team went above and beyond, surprising her with a joyful birthday song, making the celebration even more unforgettable. Their enthusiasm and warm hospitality made the night a blast.\n\nThe salmon we tried was unique and delicious, a standout dish that added to the amazing culinary experience.\n\nIf you’re looking for a place in Saigon that delivers both great food and an amazing atmosphere, Clay Saigon is definitely worth a visit!\nRead more\nWritten February 25, 2025",
